    "body": "`scripts/diffcheck.sh` writes fixed `/tmp/table.mediawiki` and `/tmp/after.diff` files. Concurrent checkouts can overwrite one another's inputs, and failed table generation does not stop the comparison.\n\nCreate a private temporary directory per invocation, clean it on exit, and stop if buildtable fails.",
